          "observation": "Every production action is recorded in the cloud audit log under the engineer's name."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "The only record of what the agent was asked, and why it acted, is the chat transcript."
        },
        {
          "locator": "runtime notes",
          "observation": "Engineers can delete their own chat history, so the request-to-action record is not tamper resistant."
        },
        {
          "locator": "prompt.md:1-3",
          "observation": "The prompt instructs the agent to deploy services or run migrations in production and says not to ask for confirmation, increasing the importance of attributable records for consequential actions."
